.TH XD\-SCANNERS 1 2026-10-18 XeonDesktop "XeonDesktop Manual"
.SH NAME
xd\-scanners \- Scanners and Cameras
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SY xd\-scanners
.YS
.SY xd\-scanners
.B \-\-scan
.I device
.YS
.SY xd\-scanners
.B \-\-camera
.I model
.I port
.YS
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xd\-scanners
is Windows XP's Scanners and Cameras folder: scanners from SANE and
cameras from libgphoto2, which both find devices themselves.
A device's Properties tests it; opening a device starts the Scanner and
Camera Wizard, which scans pictures or copies them from the camera.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-scan " device"
Only the wizard, for the SANE device
.IR device .
.TP
.BI \-\-camera " model port"
Only the wizard, for a camera, given as for
.BR "gphoto2 \-\-camera" " \fImodel\fR " "\-\-port" " \fIport\fR."
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of the options and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SANE_CONFIG_DIR
SANE's configuration, as for every SANE program.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scanimage (1),
.BR gphoto2 (1),
.BR xd\-control (1)
